                                "example_id": "836ee559-6787-464f-9f39-cbfef2cf6a15",
                                "sense_id": "98beab41-0219-39d2-bc5a-0e14b383c24a",
                                "text": "\"We could do still better. Suppose that while transactions run, we use an asynchronous multicast to lazily inform replicas of locks held locally and to pretransmit update logs.\""
